      "uid": "zhcn:fd221a34ffa311b0aa7685d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果跟你在一起的话，我想我就能创造出\r\n更加精彩的“奇迹”，给大家带来快乐的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "872af60c42c7c532183062bc2fe99bc91d6582c06b6a1990dc59ba6ed61246d6",
