      "uid": "zhcn:9d9bef6a002a26653cd189f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，我与给大家带来快乐的表演家\r\n富士奇石签下了专属契约……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f2ab3787b06135ed8c682bcc26e76123c7d4c372af56cf72ba11663a58f0d04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
