      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，它跟前几天的模拟赛是截然不同的。\r\n不论是肩负期待的分量，还是参赛选手们的水平。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2a29871592e6fc7e23a19fdce5107626bbac7dce4e0e3c57ceda4303e76d01b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
