      "source_text": "……偶尔，会有孩子像那样离开学园。\r\n我就会被一种无力感所折磨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8308a4912d46cd0c3068ebf8449eb05ef7ba8863baabaa878840488f8bfbd762",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
