    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0daadd5c247c06083b794d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "怎样，才能让梦想破灭了的孩子开心起来呢？\r\n我还让她露出了那样寂寞的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f7bf5a3a5635bf964a315a76bff8b3909efb44d7023a56642bfa769937a06b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1005/storytimeline_041005005.json",
      "json_path": [
