    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5da603d09753edfaf58be00a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "――说起来，富士奇石曾说过，她放弃了当演员\r\n的梦想，而选择了赛跑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c8035b2194cff21577655a6b09a27b9f6d6279873b2613c2ae5676526fb2a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
