      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的梦想？　那当然是，\r\n『创造“奇迹”，给大家带来快乐』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfd9cc2f9469f2fd2a21186459c521ca07b190ec8266d69e1102301e4624260c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1005/storytimeline_041005005.json",
      "json_path": [
