      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……说完，富士奇石却沉默了。\r\n她露出了陷入沉思的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f99989eaa35b0ff694949ba63c56dd5e0c176e7182d7d95b8a394ac70408ba0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
